<title>USA: Mallinckrodt in hospital supply pact.</title>
<headline>Mallinckrodt in hospital supply pact.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mallinckrodt Inc said Wednesday it entered into an exclusive agreement to supply radiopharmaceuticals and associated products to the 1,800 owner hospitals and affiliates of Premier Inc.</p>
<p>The five-year agreement is effective April 1.</p>
<p>Mallinckrodt said it already supplies Premier members with a variety of contrast media for use with X-ray and other imaging technologies.</p>
<p>Mallinckrodt serves specialty markets in human healthcare and chemicals.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
